Training material prepared for the OQ "Advanced AI for IT" program,
27 September - 1 October 2026.


WHY THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC

It is public for one practical reason: so that program participants can
clone it and open its notebooks in Google Colab without needing a GitHub
account of their own. Public visibility is a convenience for the room. It
is not a grant of any licence, and nothing here is open source.


PERMITTED

  - Program participants and OQ staff may clone, run, modify and keep
    this material for their own learning and internal use, during the
    program and afterwards.


NOT PERMITTED without prior written permission from AI Guru

  - Redistributing this material, in whole or in part, publicly or
    commercially.
  - Using it to deliver training, paid or unpaid, to any other audience.
  - Incorporating it into another course, product, service or model
    training set.


SYNTHETIC DATA

Every document, ticket, record, image, name, site code, equipment tag and
system name in this repository is synthetic and was generated for
teaching. No OQ material of any kind was used: no documents, data, site
names, employee names or system names. See corpus/README.md for how the
corpus was built and how that is verified. Any resemblance to real OQ
material is coincidental.


